  "body": "Adds the `set_raw_stock_only` row to the stock section of `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`, after `set_stock`, and bumps `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` to 20 (main's 19 was taken by #965). Merges main. Files only, no build.\n\nRow as added:\n\n> `set_raw_stock_only { \"on\": boolean }`: For a stock made from a model (`set_stock` `from_model`), say whether that source model is raw stock only - a casting or blank you cut into, not the finished part. Default off: the model is judged like every model. On: the gouge verdict leaves it out. One undo step. Refused by name when there is no stock yet (\"set the stock first\"), when the stock is not made from a model, or when the source model has no geometry. The mark holds only while the model is still the stock's source and its geometry and placement (position and rotation) are unchanged, so moving or turning the model voids it; otherwise it is ignored and the post says so by name. An operation that machines the model (as its source or in a boundary pick) puts it back in the verdict. If the mark leaves nothing to judge, the post is refused by name.\n\nWhere each fact was read (on main):\n\n- Name, parameter `on` (boolean, required), default off, one undo step: `crates/app/src/mcp/setup_tools.rs:28` (registration in `TOOLS`, aggregated by `mcp/tools.rs`), `:254-256` (schema), `:259-264` (handler: `env.history.execute`).\n- Refusals: `crates/app/src/commands/stock_source_only.rs:34` (\"no stock '...' - set the stock first\"), `:47` (source model not in the document or no geometry), and the not-from-a-model refusal in `new` (same file, ~line 56).\n- Placement in the validity check: `crates/app/src/stock_print.rs:1-6` (fingerprint hashes local facets then `Location`: position and rotation).\n- Mark holds only while source and geometry match, otherwise ignored with a named note: `crates/app/src/stock_source.rs:7-16` (module doc), `:113-126` (`void_note`).\n- Operation naming the model puts it back in the verdict: `crates/app/src/stock_source.rs:166-167` (`stock_only_model`).\n- Post refused when nothing is left to judge: `crates/app/src/stock_source.rs:187-201` (`nothing_judged`).\n\nPinning tests: `crates/app/tests/mcp_setup.rs` `set_raw_stock_only_marks_the_stock_source_through_the_command` (refusals and the on/off round trip through MCP); `crates/app/tests/stock_source_verdict.rs` (verdict, void note, nothing-judged). Not exercised here: no build or test run (text-only change).\n\nOther references checked with `git grep -n set_raw_stock_only -- .claude crates docs`: nothing in the skill or docs contradicts the row.\n\nPROCESS_VERSION 20 (a process change). What a fork must do: pull the process files from upstream, per the pinned issue #681: `git checkout upstream/main -- AGENTS.md .claude/agents .claude/skills .claude/PROCESS_VERSION xtask .cargo/config.toml scripts/gate.ps1 scripts/gate.sh scripts/release.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.sh`, then commit on a `process-sync` branch. Announce on #681 when this merges.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1106\n",
